    "summary": "ImageMagick has a heap Buffer Overflow in ImageMagick MVG decoder",
    "details": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. In versions below both 7.1.2-19 and 6.9.13-44, a heap buffer overflow occurs in the MVG decoder that could result in an out of bounds write when processing a crafted image. This issue has been fixed in versions 6.9.13-44 and 7.1.2-19.",
    "severity": [
